[[0,1322579,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-03T09:47:28","smokratez","",[],"","Picture of a artist reconstruction of an Egyptian mummy.","http://www.ceskatelevize.cz/ct24/sites/default/files/styles/scale_1180/public/images/1801592-bcde3e7d22fcda337feba166731465d0cd52356aec7d7d3434492b057c8b.jpg?itok=TZB_1uFS","pics"],[1,6471390,0,2,1,1,"2016-10-03T09:48:05","smokratez","",[],"<p>I was talking about ancient Egypt with a guy on voat a while ago, and he didn't believe me when I said that they were white. </p>"],[2,6471878,6471390,2,0,2,"2016-10-03T12:50:14","Dumb_Comment_Bot","",[],"<p>Because every museum uses a black mannquine for Egyptians. IRL a portion of mummies had naturally red hair. Also Copts ( much closer to ancient Egyptians) look way whiter than Arabs (invaded Egypt).</p>"],[3,6471940,6471878,2,2,0,"2016-10-03T13:03:42","smokratez","",[],"<p>We have a winner. </p>"]]
