[[0,1322582,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-03T09:50:37","highly_paid_orgy_pro","",[],"","In your opinion, what is a \"rite of passage\" that every young man must make?","","AskVoat"],[1,6471680,0,3,1,2,"2016-10-03T11:53:39","middle_path","",[],"<p>Being alone and poor for at least a few months. I had this happen to me for 2 and a half months. I couldn't afford anything, no work, no family or friends. You learn a lot about yourself during times like these. </p>"],[2,6471721,6471680,2,0,2,"2016-10-03T12:07:07","EllenPaoisamanbaby","",[],"<p>Would you say it helps teach the middle path? Having and not having?</p>"],[3,6471781,6471721,2,0,2,"2016-10-03T12:19:56","middle_path","",[],"<p>That's what I found - eventually. But more than anything, it helped me live with myself. I know so many poeple who can't be alone with themselves. If you do it for a while, it forces you to adapt. I learned to not hate myself. </p>"],[1,6471750,0,4,0,4,"2016-10-03T12:12:52","EllenPaoisamanbaby","[e]",[],"<p>In my opinion, every young man should experience failure, but action, in order to understand ability, and a drive to improve. For example, every young man needs to get shot down by a girl to learn about humiliation, but that shame should fuel his determination to not get shot down again. To do something to reduce the odds, like learning to not be so serious, improving his physique, or improving his station in life. </p>\n<p>Ps, a woman can inspire the best in us, yes?</p>"],[2,6473960,6471750,1,0,1,"2016-10-03T17:44:41","Aboresh","",[],"<p>Failure is the absolute best teacher and more people need to embrace and learn from it. If you look at a lot of the early presidents, before they did political stuff, they were massive, massive fuck ups who experienced and learned from failure.</p>"],[1,6471827,0,1,0,1,"2016-10-03T12:31:19","profanion","",[],"<p>To sort out the things that were taught to you. Then to see how many of them are very good tips and advice and how much of it was crap or something that no longer applies to current environment.</p>"],[1,6473824,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-03T17:30:01","ToFat2Fish","",[],"<p>Sticking your penis inside a sex toy that was completely created from stuff laying around the house.</p>"]]
[[0,1322583,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-03T09:50:45","cuntfuckgaf","",[],"","I CANT EVEN.... FUCK","http://www.neogaf.com/forum/showpost.php?p=218887541&postcount=299","NeoFAG"],[1,6471397,0,3,0,3,"2016-10-03T09:51:01","cuntfuckgaf","",[],"<p>Not even self-aware enough to realise they're a parody of themselves. Kill yourself.</p>"],[1,6471422,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-03T10:00:19","derram","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://archive.is/n26jd\">https://archive.is/n26jd</a> : \r</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>NeoGAF - View Single Post - SIFTD (Shane Satterfield's website) robbed of everything </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://vgy.me/GU8hr1.gif\">This has been an automated message.</a></p>"],[1,6471425,0,6,0,6,"2016-10-03T10:01:19","BillBugle","",[],"<p>Shame he wasn't a woman, all these tragedies would've had a patreon going on for years</p>"],[1,6471492,0,3,0,3,"2016-10-03T10:24:20","ToiletPaper","",[],"<p>thetester77 - Junior:\r\n&quot;Feel bad for anyone losing their source of income - and their passion, but if they don't have insurance then sorry Shane thats just unthinkable that you don't make sure your income is protected some how - hard lesson &quot;</p>\n<p>I give em a few more hours before ban.</p>"],[1,6471650,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-03T11:44:14","DerVarg","",[],"<p>Who?</p>"],[1,6471741,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-03T12:10:53","JohnnyPhatsaqs","",[],"<p>That's not how insurance works. And note that the cute little statues and figures were left...</p>"]]
