[[0,1322592,0,46,0,46,"2016-10-03T10:01:27","ArsCortica","",[],"","Japanese scientist Yoshinori Ohsumi wins 2016 Nobcel Prize for Medicine for research on autophages","http://www.reuters.com/article/us-nobel-prize-medicine-idUSKCN1230TX?il=0","science"],[1,6471477,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-03T10:19:57","derram","",[],"<p><a href=\"https://archive.is/Wrac0\">https://archive.is/Wrac0</a> : \r</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Japanese scientist wins Nobel medicine prize for work on 'self-eating' cells | Reuters </p>\n</blockquote>\n<p><a href=\"https://vgy.me/fhcdzj.jpg\">This has been an automated message.</a></p>"],[1,6471579,0,3,0,3,"2016-10-03T11:12:46","AOU","",[],"<p>I too have 2 Nobcel Prizes</p>"],[2,6471785,6471579,4,0,4,"2016-10-03T12:20:35","ArsCortica","",[],"<p>I'd exchange all of my 6 Nobcel prizes for the ability to edit the title of a post...</p>"],[3,6472169,6471785,1,0,1,"2016-10-03T13:39:34","toyhammer98","",[],"<p>It's okay. Tyops (sic) in the title happen to everybody.</p>"],[1,6471915,0,2,0,2,"2016-10-03T12:57:38","aria_taint","",[],"<p>Unfortunately the guy did good work for an award that was one by Obama after he was in office for 6 minutes.\r\nThe Nobel foundation has no merit. </p>"],[2,6471944,6471915,7,0,7,"2016-10-03T13:04:08","ArsCortica","[e]",[],"<p>Except we're not talking about the Nobel prize for peace, which is handed out to everyone and his mom, but about the Nobel prize or Medicine, which has a slightly more robust framework to it. </p>"],[2,6472506,6471915,2,0,2,"2016-10-03T14:29:23","Laurentius_the_pyro","[e]",[],"<p>Nobel prizes in medicine and physics are still valuable, it's only the peace prize that has been devalued due to being given out as political favors.</p>"],[2,6473263,6471915,1,0,1,"2016-10-03T16:14:19","aeschynanthus","",[],"<p>The Nobel Peace Prize laureate is selected by the Norwegian Nobel Committee. That means they decide themselves who the prize goes to. Whereas the prizes in sciences and literature are only <em>proposed</em> by the respective committees; the actual laureate is decided by the Nobel Assembly. (I don't know what the composition of that is.)</p>"],[1,6472481,0,0,2,-2,"2016-10-03T14:25:18","dontforgetaboutevil","",[],"<p>Oh a nobel prize for healing? Let me guess he makes a living squishing puppy testicles?</p>"],[1,6472499,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-03T14:27:51","Laurentius_the_pyro","[e]",[],"<p>Congratulations to Yoshinori for the Nobcel Prize.</p>"],[1,6473098,0,0,0,0,"2016-10-03T15:54:23","Fooj","",[],"<p>I'll have one nobcel a la mode please.</p>"]]
